---
import ActivityTerm from "~/components/activity-term.astro";
import { ACTIVITIES } from "~/lib/constants";
---

<section
  class="mx-auto flex w-full max-w-md flex-col items-center gap-y-3 text-center text-zinc-100"
  aria-labelledby="intro-heading"
>
  <div class="flex flex-col items-center gap-y-1">
    <h1
      id="intro-heading"
      class="font-sans text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight sm:text-2xl md:text-3xl"
    >
      Hey, I&apos;m Abraham
    </h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-zinc-300 sm:text-sm">
      Full-Stack Developer, Based in Baja California, Mexico
    </p>
  </div>
  <p class="text-pretty text-zinc-500 mt-4">
    If It&apos;s anything Web related, I&apos;m on it:
    <span class="text-zinc-200">Websites and Apps, APIs, Servers, Desktop and Mobile</span>.
    Experienced in <span class="text-zinc-200">Education, Business, and Government</span> sectors. After work,
    <ActivityTerm label="Coffee" descriptionHtml={ACTIVITIES.COFFEE.description} />
    ,{" "}
    <ActivityTerm label="Movies & Shows" descriptionHtml={ACTIVITIES.MEDIA.description} />
    ,{" "}
    <ActivityTerm label="Games" descriptionHtml={ACTIVITIES.GAMES.description} />
    , and{" "}
    <ActivityTerm label="Music" descriptionHtml={ACTIVITIES.MUSIC.description} />
    .
  </p>
</section>
